  function textEditSettingsMarkup() {
    const { ID } = rtx;
    return `<details class="text-edit-settings" id="${ID}-text-edit-settings">
      <summary class="text-edit-heading"><span class="text-edit-heading-icon" aria-hidden="true">记</span><span><strong>让小此整理资料</strong><small>自动记住本聊天的重要设定</small></span><span class="text-edit-heading-arrow" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary>
      <div class="text-edit-content">
        <section class="text-edit-main" aria-label="整理开关">
          <div class="text-edit-main-copy"><span class="text-edit-eyebrow">本聊天的记忆本</span><span class="text-edit-badge" id="${ID}-text-edit-badge">未开启</span><p>让重要的设定留下来，<br>不用每次从头提醒。</p></div>
          <button type="button" class="text-edit-switch" id="${ID}-text-edit-enable" data-action="text-edit-toggle" aria-pressed="false"><span class="text-edit-switch-track" aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="${ID}-text-edit-enable-label">开启整理</span></button>
          <p class="text-edit-scope-note" id="${ID}-text-edit-scope-note">可整理本聊天资料和世界系统自身，不会修改其他条目。开关会一直记住；手动开启会分别核实并保存工作设置和当前命名预设的 Izumi世界系统。切换聊天或恢复开关不会自动开启世界系统。</p>
        </section>
        <section class="text-edit-card" aria-labelledby="${ID}-text-edit-workspace-title">
          <div class="text-edit-card-head"><h3 id="${ID}-text-edit-workspace-title">本聊天资料</h3><span class="text-edit-count" id="${ID}-text-edit-workspace-count">0 条资料</span></div>
          <p class="text-edit-book"><span>资料存储位置</span><strong id="${ID}-text-edit-workspace-name">开启后读取</strong></p>
          <ul class="text-edit-list" id="${ID}-text-edit-workspace-list"><li class="text-edit-empty"><strong>开启后查看本聊天资料</strong><span>关闭整理不会删除或停止读取已有资料。</span></li></ul>
          <div class="text-edit-card-foot"><span class="text-edit-meta">角色设定和其他资料仍由酒馆照常发送。</span><button type="button" class="text-edit-button" data-action="memory-editor-open">资料总编辑</button><button type="button" class="text-edit-button" data-action="text-edit-refresh">刷新列表</button></div>
        </section>
        <details class="text-edit-fold" id="${ID}-text-edit-range"><summary><span>更多编辑范围</span><small>可选</small></summary><div class="text-edit-fold-body">
          <label class="text-edit-reference text-edit-range-option"><input type="checkbox" id="${ID}-text-edit-allow-all"><span><strong>也允许编辑其他条目</strong><small>保存此选择；改变范围会取消旧轮次和正文选择，不会自动开启整理。</small></span></label>
          <p class="text-edit-caution">高级预设编辑默认关闭。打开此项仍须明确选择资源和提示词ID；同名条目不是授权。</p>
        </div></details>
        <details class="text-edit-fold" id="${ID}-text-edit-reference"><summary><span>给小此参考的正文</span><small>按需选择</small></summary><div class="text-edit-fold-body">
          <p class="text-edit-meta">把勾选条目的完整正文额外发给小此，方便按原文修改。平常新增、整理资料通常不用勾，不必全选，选得越多越占上下文。勾选不增加编辑权限，也不改变酒馆原本发送哪些内容；更改从下一次回复生效。</p><p class="text-edit-meta" id="${ID}-text-edit-selection-summary">已选 0 项 · 只额外发送正文，不扩大权限</p><div class="text-edit-reference-list" id="${ID}-text-edit-context"><p class="text-edit-empty">开启整理后，可从已允许的条目中选择正文。</p></div>
        </div></details>
        <section class="text-edit-card text-edit-result" aria-labelledby="${ID}-text-edit-result-title"><div class="text-edit-card-head"><h3 id="${ID}-text-edit-result-title">最近结果</h3><span class="text-edit-result-label" id="${ID}-text-edit-result-label">未开启</span></div>
          <p id="${ID}-text-edit-result-action">开启后从下一次回复开始整理，已记住的本聊天资料仍会照常读取。</p><p class="text-edit-notice" id="${ID}-text-edit-notice"></p><span class="text-edit-live" id="${ID}-text-edit-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">未开启</span>
          <div class="text-edit-card-foot"><span class="text-edit-meta">核实持久回执；不重试旧提交，仅在来源和字段相符时撤回失效来源的记录效果。</span><button type="button" class="text-edit-button" data-action="text-edit-recheck">检查保存结果</button><button type="button" class="text-edit-button" data-action="text-edit-discard-pending" id="${ID}-text-edit-discard-pending" hidden>放弃未决</button></div><ul class="text-edit-rejected" id="${ID}-text-edit-rejected" hidden></ul>
          <details class="text-edit-technical" id="${ID}-text-edit-transport-recovery" hidden><summary>取出暂存工具正文</summary><p id="${ID}-text-edit-transport-recovery-note">仅在点击后读取暂存文本，不自动补写或执行。</p><button type="button" data-world-next-recovery-open>显示暂存文本</button><textarea id="${ID}-text-edit-transport-recovery-text" readonly aria-label="暂存工具正文" rows="6"></textarea><button type="button" data-world-next-recovery-select>全选以复制</button><button type="button" data-world-next-recovery-discard>放弃暂存并重置</button></details>
          <details class="text-edit-technical" id="${ID}-text-edit-result-technical"><summary>详细信息</summary><pre id="${ID}-text-edit-result-details">暂无执行记录。</pre></details>
        </section>
        <details class="text-edit-fold" id="${ID}-text-edit-history"><summary><span>修改记录</span><small>本地撤回与恢复</small></summary><div class="text-edit-fold-body"><p class="text-edit-meta" id="${ID}-text-edit-history-status">7版资料修订保存在独立专用书；预设逆补丁保存在本浏览器。</p><ul class="text-edit-list" id="${ID}-text-edit-history-list"></ul><p class="text-edit-caution">仅按同书来源身份和字段核实撤回记录效果；来源隐藏仍有效。高级预设撤回与恢复仍需当前逐ID授权，清浏览器缓存会丢失预设回执。切回旧回复页不会自动恢复或重执行指令；有冲突时不会覆盖手改。旧版资料不迁移。</p><p class="text-edit-meta" id="${ID}-text-edit-hide-status">楼层编号是获准的持久原文例外，会修改普通AI的mes/swipes及导出；显示投影不回写原文，原生隐藏不删除磁盘内容。</p></div></details>
        <details class="text-edit-fold" id="${ID}-text-edit-preview-fold"><summary><span>小此会收到什么</span><small>内容预览</small></summary><div class="text-edit-fold-body"><p class="text-edit-meta" id="${ID}-text-edit-preview-meta">预览示例 · 尚无发送轮次</p><pre class="text-edit-preview" id="${ID}-text-edit-preview">开启整理并刷新列表后，可查看与实际发送使用同一规则的内容。</pre><button type="button" class="text-edit-button" data-action="text-edit-preview">刷新预览</button></div></details>
        <details class="text-edit-technical" id="${ID}-text-edit-technical"><summary>资料如何保存</summary><p>7版资料放在随机命名的独立专用书，不占角色原有绑定。原生条目物理关闭，由本聊天经过来源核实后受控发送。7版资料与修改记录支持重新加载；不迁移旧版资料。</p><p>聊天绑定和新来源先保存并独立回读核实，随后才允许写书。删除用开头、结尾两段原文定位正文范围，包含两端；只改已授权条目的内容，不删除条目、世界书或绑定。正文含不安全模板或超过上限时会拒绝，不会静默截断。</p></details>
      </div>
    </details>`;
  }
  function panelMarkup() {
    const { ID, LAYERS, adviceControlMarkup, adviceSettingsButtonMarkup, compatibilityPanelMarkup, compatibilityStatus, helpMarkup, sanitizerControlMarkup, sanitizerSettingsButtonMarkup, textEditSettingsMarkup } = rtx;
    return `
      <header class="panel-header" data-drag-handle>
        <div class="header-top">
          <div class="header-title"><span class="kicker">IZUMI / FLOATING WINDOW</span><h2>泉此方设置</h2></div>
          <div class="header-actions"><button class="icon-btn" data-action="night" title="夜间模式" aria-label="夜间模式" aria-pressed="false">☾</button><button class="icon-btn danger" data-action="shutdown" title="彻底关闭本次悬浮窗" aria-label="彻底关闭本次悬浮窗">⏻</button><button class="icon-btn" data-action="close" title="收起" aria-label="收起">×</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="header-bottom">
          <button class="help-btn" data-action="help" title="打开使用教程" aria-label="打开使用教程"><b aria-hidden="true">i</b><span>使用教程</span></button>
          <div class="header-status-tools"><div class="sanitizer-control-group">${sanitizerControlMarkup('panel')}${sanitizerSettingsButtonMarkup('panel')}</div><div class="advice-control-group">${adviceControlMarkup('panel')}${adviceSettingsButtonMarkup('panel')}</div><div class="header-preset"><span id="${ID}-preset">当前预设：读取中</span><button class="icon-btn small" data-action="refresh" title="刷新" aria-label="刷新">↻</button></div></div>
        </div>
      </header>
      ${textEditSettingsMarkup()}
      <details class="api-box" id="${ID}-api-form">
        <summary class="api-summary"><span>附加参数</span><small id="${ID}-api-status">读取中</small></summary>
        <div class="api-content">
        <div class="api-head">
          <div><strong>★ 泉此方方案配置</strong><small class="api-subtitle">当前聊天补全连接</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="api-grid api-main-grid">
          <div class="api-field">
            <label for="${ID}-api-main-api">API</label>
            <input id="${ID}-api-main-api" readonly aria-readonly="true">
          </div>
          <div class="api-field">
            <label for="${ID}-api-source">聊天补全来源</label>
            <input id="${ID}-api-source" readonly aria-readonly="true">
          </div>
          <div class="api-field wide">
            <label for="${ID}-api-url">自定义端点（基础 URL）</label>
            <input id="${ID}-api-url" autocomplete="url" placeholder="https://api.example.com/v1">
          </div>
          <div class="api-field wide">
            <label for="${ID}-api-model">输入模型名</label>
            <div class="model-picker">
              <input id="${ID}-api-model" list="${ID}-api-models" autocomplete="off" placeholder="模型 ID">
              <select id="${ID}-api-model-list" aria-label="可用模型"><option value="">尚未拉取模型</option></select>
            </div>
            <datalist id="${ID}-api-models"></datalist>
          </div>
          <div class="api-field wide">
            <label for="${ID}-api-key">API 密钥 <small>仅在本机方案中保存</small></label>
            <input id="${ID}-api-key" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="留空就用酒馆当前的密钥">
            <span class="field-help">实际请求走的还是酒馆自己的密钥配置。这里填的不会显示在方案列表或状态提示里。</span>
          </div>
          <div class="api-field wide">
            <label for="${ID}-api-post-processing">提示词后处理</label>
            <select id="${ID}-api-post-processing">
              <option value="">未选择</option>
              <optgroup label="使用工具">
                <option value="merge_tools">合并连续角色（使用工具）</option>
                <option value="semi_tools">半严格交替（使用工具）</option>
                <option value="strict_tools">严格交替（使用工具）</option>
              </optgroup>
              <optgroup label="不使用工具">
                <option value="merge">合并连续角色</option>
                <option value="semi">半严格交替</option>
                <option value="strict">严格交替</option>
                <option value="single">单条用户消息</option>
              </optgroup>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="api-section-title">生成偏好 <small>写回当前酒馆设置</small></div>
        <div class="api-grid api-generation-grid">
          <div class="api-field"><label for="${ID}-api-max-tokens">回复长度</label><input id="${ID}-api-max-tokens" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="4096"></div>
          <div class="api-field"><label for="${ID}-api-temperature">随机程度</label><input id="${ID}-api-temperature" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0.7"></div>
          <div class="api-field"><label for="${ID}-api-top-p">多样性</label><input id="${ID}-api-top-p" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0.9"></div>
          <label class="api-check"><input id="${ID}-api-stream" type="checkbox"> 流式输出</label>
        </div>
        <details class="advanced">
          <summary>附加参数</summary>
          <div class="advanced-content">
            <div class="api-grid">
              <div class="api-field wide">
                <label for="${ID}-api-include-body">包含主体参数 <small>YAML 对象</small></label>
                <textarea id="${ID}-api-include-body" spellcheck="false" placeholder="top_k: 20&#10;repetition_penalty: 1.1"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="api-field wide">
                <label for="${ID}-api-exclude-body">排除主体参数 <small>YAML 数组</small></label>
                <textarea id="${ID}-api-exclude-body" spellcheck="false" placeholder="- frequency_penalty&#10;- presence_penalty"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="api-field wide">
                <label for="${ID}-api-include-headers">包含请求标头 <small>YAML 对象</small></label>
                <textarea id="${ID}-api-include-headers" spellcheck="false" placeholder="CustomHeader: 自定义值&#10;AnotherHeader: 自定义值"></textarea>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <div class="api-actions">
          <button class="command primary" data-action="api-apply">★ 应用当前设置</button>
          <button class="command" data-action="api-read">↻ 读取当前</button>
          <button class="command" data-action="api-models">⌕ 拉取模型</button>
        </div>
        <div class="api-key-options">
          <label class="api-check"><input id="${ID}-api-save-key" type="checkbox"> 把密钥一起存在本机（只存在这个浏览器里，导出文件不会包含）</label>
        </div>
        <small class="api-warning">勾选后，密钥会以明文存在这个浏览器的本地存储里，只有本机能读到；不写进酒馆的密钥库，也不出现在提示和日志里。脚本的所有导出（酒馆预设、小方案包、存储报告）都不会带上它。如果这台电脑不是你一个人用，就别勾～</small>
        </div>
      </details>
      <section class="overview-card"><div class="plan-banner" id="${ID}-plan-banner"></div></section>
      <section class="workspace-card">
      <nav class="tabs">${LAYERS.map((layer) => `<button class="tab" data-action="tab" data-layer="${layer.id}" aria-selected="false"><span>${layer.label}</span><b data-count="${layer.id}">0</b></button>`).join("")}</nav>
      <nav class="function-tabs" id="${ID}-function-tabs" aria-label="层内子区" hidden></nav>
      <div class="layer-plans" id="${ID}-layer-plans" hidden></div>
      <div class="hint" id="${ID}-hint"></div>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <div class="search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="${ID}-search" type="search" placeholder="筛选当前目录" aria-label="筛选条目"><button class="clear-search" data-action="clear-search" title="清空搜索" aria-label="清空搜索">×</button></div>
        <select class="display-state" id="${ID}-display-state" title="仅筛选显示，不改变操作范围" aria-label="条目显示状态"><option value="all">全部</option><option value="enabled">已开</option><option value="disabled">已关</option></select>
        <label class="search-body-toggle" title="开启后同时查找条目正文"><input id="${ID}-search-body" type="checkbox"> 搜正文</label>
        <button class="mini add-entry" data-action="add" title="添加到当前层">＋ 添加</button>
        <span class="count" id="${ID}-count">0 项</span>
      </div>
      <div class="items" id="${ID}-items"></div>
      </section>
      <section class="plans">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">SILLYTAVERN PRESET</span><h3>当前酒馆预设</h3></div><span class="muted" id="${ID}-save-target">读取中</span></div>
           <div class="storage-note">新增、编辑、启用和拖拽排序会自动写入当前命名酒馆预设；批量导入/导出也直接使用 Tavern Helper 预设接口，不写入 Izumi 参考文件。</div>
        <label class="plan-name">方案缓存名称 <input id="${ID}-plan-name" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" placeholder="例如 3.1p 或 3.7f"></label>
        <div class="plan-tools">
           <button class="command primary" data-action="save">保存方案缓存</button>
           <button class="command primary" data-action="save-current">保存当前酒馆预设</button>
           <button class="command" data-action="manager">打开酒馆预设管理器</button>
           <button class="command" data-action="import">批量导入酒馆预设</button>
           <button class="command" data-action="export">导出全部酒馆预设</button>
           <button class="command" data-action="export-current">导出当前酒馆预设</button>
           <button class="command" data-action="export-layer-plans">导出全部小方案</button>
           <button class="command" data-action="export-quick-plans">导出快捷方案</button>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-list" id="${ID}-plans"></div>
      </section>
      <details class="compatibility-status" id="${ID}-compatibility">${compatibilityPanelMarkup(compatibilityStatus.snapshot())}</details>
      <button class="resize-handle" data-resize-handle title="拖动缩放面板" aria-label="拖动缩放面板">↘</button>
      <div class="editor-overlay" id="${ID}-editor" hidden>
